{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;You ain't worth a dollar.&quot;</strong></h2><br>Rodeo Clown is a visual novel/walking sim about the sorriest man on Earth. <br><br>Fill the shoes of Des and embark on a journey that'll take you to the sleepy backwater of Aurora, Texas. Not much happens in Aurora, besides the occasional tornado or distant gunshot. There's a tractor museum (closed), a beautiful mural, angsty teenagers, ominous signs, totem tennis and... that's about it.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042710/extras/car.gif?t=1742957987\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;I reckon you could summarise the history of Aurora into two categories. Pre-rodeo clown massacre, and post-rodeo clown massacre.&quot;</strong></h2><br>Will you find the answers to all your problems in Aurora? Des hopes so, but Des hopes for a lot of things.<br><br>Is it all in his head, or is there some greater power beating him into submission? Des needs it to be the latter. Life is easier when it's not your fault.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;You got sad eyes. Like you seen your dog get run over.&quot;</strong></h2><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042710/extras/gif.gif?t=1742957987\" />","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Goin' Out West","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3042710/7384978a484ce56043d4c2feda326e45768cd097.jpg"},{"name":"Rock the Casbah","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3042710/bf27548dd5922b049551ac9010a4bcfad540c15b.jpg"},{"name":"Television Rules the Nation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3042710/b176b13f9ca16116802a6a1b6868671410f9420d.jpg"},{"name":"Black Paint","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3042710/aa695faf70a869a73a6a0cc8daf91f97f75e